OL,5,G0100 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,6,G     Speeders
OL,7,     FThe PCs tail an uninsured vehicle.
OL,8,     FWhen they finally catch up and
OL,9,     Fquestion the suspect, they
OL,10,     Fdiscover the driver has never
OL,11,     Ftaken a driving test.
OL,12,G0200 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FProfiling the work of a high-speed
OL,14,     Fpolice interception unit, with an
OL,15,     Fepic 80mph pursuit involving eight
OL,16,     Fpolice cars and an 'eye in the
OL,17,     Fsky', leading to carnage on the
OL,18,     FYorkshire roads.
